<% title = 'Generate Dummy Data' %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<h1>Generate Dummy Data</h1>
<p class="muted">Menu buat sediain data dummy (insert permanen, bukan rollback) supaya test case Overtime bisa dibuat bebas tanpa ganggu data asli.</p>

<div class="dummy-hub-grid">
  <a class="dummy-hub-card" href="/dummy-data/employees">
    <h3>Dummy Employee</h3>
    <p>Generate master karyawan dummy (nik, nama, dll) di <code>ms_employees</code>.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="dummy-hub-card" href="/dummy-data/attendance-shift">
    <h3>Dummy Presensi &amp; Jadwal Shift</h3>
    <p>Generate presensi (hadir/sakit/abstain), jadwal shift (off/long-shift/double-shift) secara batch.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="dummy-hub-card" href="/dummy-data/overtime-generate">
    <h3>Generate Overtime Request dari Presensi</h3>
    <p>Scan <code>rpt_attendances</code> - cari hari long-shift/gap-shift, lalu insert overtime request (approved) yang sesuai.</p>
  </a>
  <a class="dummy-hub-card" href="/dummy-data/clear">
    <h3>Clear Data Presensi/Shift/Overtime/Permission</h3>
    <p>Hapus permanen data presensi, jadwal shift, overtime request, atau permission berdasarkan company, employee, dan rentang tanggal.</p>
  </a>
</div>

